  "title": "Independently verify published dw.quantities.standard and exact three-library NuGet binary closure",
  "commitMessage": "test: verify published Standard NuGet and exact dependency binaries",
  "timeoutSeconds": 1800,
  "projectNodes": [
    "M7"
  ],
  "contribution": {
    "summary": "Independently verify the physical published Standard NuGet archive, its two exact published package dependencies and the ten-case source-free consumer from NUGET_LOCAL.",
    "value": "Hash and inspect three exact immutable published archives and DLLs, check complete nuspec dependency closure using the published Dw.Tools.NuGet reader and compile one exact Standard PackageReference consumer.",
    "debtChanges": [
      "The operator's private Standard --publish and --verify PASS reports are distinct from the new independent DWF physical-feed receipt.",
      "RS143 checks only three precisely named Math packages rather than asserting safety or integrity of the entire mixed local NuGet feed.",
      "NuGet.org/public licensing, other OS/RID consumers, installed-package rollback, crash recovery and Discovery/Decision integrations remain unqualified.",
      "Other Math packages are not implicitly released. The next package must be selected from the real dependency graph and receive its own qualified candidate and publication gates."
    ],
    "nextAction": "After RS143 succeeds, inspect remaining Math packages and their real dependency order, then qualify one bounded source-free candidate against exact already published immutable package dependencies.",
    "achievements": []
  },
